1
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:11,700
Chu Mingke has eyes and hands everywhere.

2
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,700
You think that with heavy guards

3
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:15,570
he will not know about this conversation?

4
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,000
Even if he finds out, it will not matter.

5
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:21,700
His Majesty is now wary of Chu Mingke.

6
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:23,600
That gives us our chance.

7
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,630
What do you mean, Eunuch Lin?

8
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,000
Chen Lunda has already been imprisoned.

9
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,400
Under severe torture,

10
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:30,770
how long can he hold out?

11
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,630
If he gives us up,

12
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,230
then we must strike first.

13
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,630
Get rid of Chu Mingke.

14
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:25,630
Who sent you?

15
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:27,300
Lin Deng.

16
00:02:02,130 --> 00:02:03,100
They still have reinforcements.

17
00:02:03,570 --> 00:02:04,370
Where is safe?

18
00:02:05,030 --> 00:02:06,630
The secret chamber in the study.

19
00:02:11,070 --> 00:02:12,770
Slowly, slowly.

20
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,030
Why are you here?

21
00:02:17,930 --> 00:02:18,670
When one marries a chicken, one follows the chicken.

22
00:02:18,670 --> 00:02:19,829
When one marries a dog, one follows the dog.

23
00:02:20,329 --> 00:02:21,700
Of course I go wherever my lord goes.

24
00:02:27,770 --> 00:02:28,570
My blade.

25
00:02:28,930 --> 00:02:29,829
It shielded me for a moment.

26
00:02:29,829 --> 00:02:30,829
The wound is not deep.

27
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:33,670
Otherwise, no one would be here to hear you say all this.

28
00:02:33,930 --> 00:02:34,630
Thank goodness.

29
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:36,430
Thank goodness you are all right.

30
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:41,570
I am so cold.

31
00:02:44,970 --> 00:02:45,970
Your forehead is burning.

32
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,570
But there is nothing in this secret chamber.

33
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:49,100
There is you.

34
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:50,400
Mm.

35
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:52,630
I will stay with you.

36
00:03:00,970 --> 00:03:01,930
I am sleepy.

37
00:03:02,370 --> 00:03:03,770
It is too cold. Do not sleep.

38
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:08,130
Let me tell my lord a story.

39
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:11,070
Many years ago,

40
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:12,970
there was a boy.

41
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,400
He was born in Weisu,

42
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,670
yet he was cursed as a man of the Central Plains.

43
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,200
You are a Central Plains dog, aren't you?

44
00:03:20,829 --> 00:03:22,200
What are people from the Central Plains?

45
00:03:22,570 --> 00:03:24,170
He often asked himself this.

46
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,030
Don't miss it as you pass by.

47
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:27,500
Shu-embroidered handkerchiefs.

48
00:03:27,570 --> 00:03:30,000
Come see authentic pear blossom wine from the Central Plains.

49
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,900
He knew

50
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,930
he was nothing like those noble people of the Central Plains.

51
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,230
He was only a slave.

52
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,100
To survive,

53
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:41,470
he could only fight wolves.

54
00:03:46,329 --> 00:03:47,300
And then?

55
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:48,300
Then,

56
00:03:48,570 --> 00:03:49,930
a nobleman adopted him.

57
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:52,100
From then on, he no longer had to fight wolves for his life.

58
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,970
Instead, he fought on the battlefield.

59
00:03:58,270 --> 00:03:59,900
Does my lord feel sorry for me?

60
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:00,200
Mm.

61
00:04:03,570 --> 00:04:05,130
My lord's comfort makes me happy.

62
00:04:10,330 --> 00:04:11,430
This is a scar.

63
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:14,500
You have a birthmark on your neck.

64
00:04:14,730 --> 00:04:15,500
It is a scar.

65
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,630
I have had it since I was very young.

66
00:04:17,930 --> 00:04:18,930
I do not know how I got it.

67
00:04:20,269 --> 00:04:21,329
Then do you have a birthmark?

68
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:25,700
What?

69
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,900
Did my lord not look carefully that night?

70
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,430
Tell me.

71
00:04:32,230 --> 00:04:33,270
The birthmark is here.

72
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:35,570
It is normal that you did not notice.

73
00:04:37,670 --> 00:04:38,730
The same birthmark.

74
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:40,070
The same scar.

75
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:40,870
It is Chu Heng.

76
00:04:40,870 --> 00:04:41,430
What is wrong?

77
00:04:50,330 --> 00:04:51,130
Chief.

78
00:04:54,930 --> 00:04:55,730
I am here.

79
00:04:58,030 --> 00:05:00,670
Chief, your subordinate came late.

80
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:05,570
Bring me everyone involved back then.

81
00:05:06,170 --> 00:05:07,370
Be discreet.

82
00:05:08,530 --> 00:05:09,330
Yes, Chief.

83
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:17,300
Time to drink your medicine.

84
00:05:20,930 --> 00:05:22,130
Drink the medicine.

85
00:05:22,330 --> 00:05:23,370
You still have a fever.

86
00:05:23,530 --> 00:05:24,470
Whatever it is,

87
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:26,130
let them report it tomorrow.

88
00:05:27,370 --> 00:05:28,630
You have no status or title yet,

89
00:05:28,730 --> 00:05:29,730
and you already want to manage me?

90
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:32,300
Why not tell your emperor

91
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:33,170
to take me in

92
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,700
as the Commissioner's wife?

93
00:05:34,770 --> 00:05:36,100
Commissioner's wife?

94
00:05:36,170 --> 00:05:37,200
Have you no shame?

95
00:05:53,470 --> 00:05:54,470
The fever has gone down.

96
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:56,130
Rest for a few more days.

97
00:05:58,030 --> 00:05:59,230
I am not that delicate.

98
00:06:02,170 --> 00:06:03,730
You can be a little more delicate in front of me.

99
00:06:05,230 --> 00:06:07,030
Chief, your subordinate has urgent news.

100
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:09,470
Wait for me in the study.

101
00:06:09,470 --> 00:06:10,100
Yes.

102
00:06:11,130 --> 00:06:12,100
Behave yourself.

103
00:06:12,330 --> 00:06:13,570
I know, I know.

104
00:06:13,570 --> 00:06:14,170
Go take care of your work.

105
00:06:14,170 --> 00:06:15,670
I will obediently wait for you.

106
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,800
Chief.

107
00:06:21,970 --> 00:06:22,800
We found the man.

108
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,530
On the night of the palace fire eighteen years ago,

109
00:06:24,530 --> 00:06:25,830
this coachman once helped a palace servant

110
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:26,800
deliver a baby.

111
00:06:26,930 --> 00:06:29,270
This humble one greets Your Excellency.

112
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:34,730
What exactly happened that night eighteen years ago?

113
00:06:34,730 --> 00:06:37,000
I want you to tell me every detail.

114
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:40,700
If you hide anything,

115
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,370
you know the consequences.

116
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:43,870
This humble one would not dare.

117
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,400
Speak.

118
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,570
Yes.

119
00:06:46,930 --> 00:06:48,000
Eighteen years ago,

120
00:06:48,230 --> 00:06:50,100
a woman dressed as a palace attendant came late at night holding a baby.

121
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,200
She came to my door

122
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:53,670
and asked me to drive her past Yanmen Pass at night.

123
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,930
She said money was no issue,

124
00:06:56,230 --> 00:06:57,270
but it had to be kept secret.

125
00:07:02,930 --> 00:07:04,800
Who is it at this hour?

126
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:06,800
Do not make a sound.

127
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:07,700
Go to Yanmen Pass.

128
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,630
What did that child look like?

129
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:19,570
I remember the child neither cried nor fussed.

130
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:20,700
I was suspicious,

131
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:21,700
so I secretly took a look.

132
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:25,430
That child seemed to have a birthmark near the ribs.

133
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:29,930
The birthmark is here.

134
00:07:31,330 --> 00:07:32,700
It is normal that you did not notice.

135
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:39,530
Anything else?

136
00:07:39,970 --> 00:07:41,800
I took that woman to Yanmen Pass.

137
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:43,600
After taking the silver, I left.

138
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,270
But later I heard

139
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:46,630
there was a wolf disaster at Yanmen Pass.

140
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,130
Many people were bitten to death.

141
00:07:48,570 --> 00:07:50,000
I do not know what happened to that woman.

142
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:55,100
Chief.

143
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:58,170
Chief, something terrible has happened.

144
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:58,870
Weisu...

145
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:00,000
Weisu has rebelled.

146
00:08:07,370 --> 00:08:08,070
You are back.

147
00:08:08,970 --> 00:08:10,470
The weather in your Shunjing is truly strange.

148
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,870
It has been pouring rain for days.

149
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:15,130
What is wrong, my lord?

150
00:08:15,730 --> 00:08:16,830
Why are you so angry?

151
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,770
Stop pretending, Helian Zhao.

152
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:21,530
It is meaningless.

153
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:23,300
My lord truly is sharp.

154
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:26,130
Since you guessed I had arrangements in Shunjing,

155
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,330
you should have killed me.

156
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:29,170
Yet you have kept me alive.

157
00:08:29,170 --> 00:08:30,470
That means I am useful to you.

158
00:08:34,830 --> 00:08:35,730
No.

159
00:08:36,270 --> 00:08:37,770
Then you should kill me now.

160
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,929
Otherwise I will turn Shunjing upside down

161
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,970
and kill your emperor.

162
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,530
You cannot.

163
00:08:44,770 --> 00:08:46,100
Why can I not?

164
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,730
A hundred Weisu guards

165
00:08:49,670 --> 00:08:50,830
came with me for the sole purpose of killing him.

166
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,530
Take one more step,

167
00:08:53,470 --> 00:08:54,800
and I will kill you.

168
00:08:56,130 --> 00:08:57,200
You can barely hold your sword steady.

169
00:08:57,570 --> 00:08:58,830
Do not say such lies, my lord.

170
00:08:58,870 --> 00:08:59,400
My lord.

171
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,600
You are the son of the rebel Shan Muchuan.

172
00:09:01,470 --> 00:09:02,730
No matter whether this battle is won or lost,

173
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:04,800
Shunjing will no longer have a place for you.

174
00:09:06,130 --> 00:09:06,770
My lord.

175
00:09:08,570 --> 00:09:09,370
No.

176
00:09:10,470 --> 00:09:11,770
I am the son of Marquis Dingyuan.

177
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,570
The young master of the Yulin Border Cavalry.

178
00:09:13,970 --> 00:09:14,900
Aside from going to war,

179
00:09:15,530 --> 00:09:17,000
I have no reason to go to Weisu.

180
00:09:20,570 --> 00:09:23,130
If your adoptive father's body is not in Weisu,

181
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,130
or if you still have a mother...

182
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,000
My lord.

183
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:27,930
Slaves have no parents.

184
00:09:27,930 --> 00:09:29,100
Only benefactors.

185
00:09:29,230 --> 00:09:30,030
I told you.

186
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,630
You are also my benefactor.

187
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,000
Come with me, my lord.

188
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:44,370
What do you mean?

189
00:09:44,630 --> 00:09:45,770
I am returning this blade to you.

190
00:09:46,430 --> 00:09:47,570
From now on, our bond is severed.

191
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,170
The Embroidered Uniform Guard is about to arrive.

192
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:50,570
I asked what you mean.

193
00:09:51,130 --> 00:09:52,330
I am not your benefactor.

194
00:09:52,730 --> 00:09:53,530
Helian Zhao.

195
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:57,770
Run. Do not come looking for me again.

196
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:03,530
General.

197
00:10:03,530 --> 00:10:06,130
The matter you asked me to investigate is clear now.

198
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,070
The jade pendant was the old general's war trophy.

199
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:10,670
The Imperial Noble Consort once sent a maid

200
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:11,870
to deliver a child to the old general to raise.

201
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,270
The jade pendant was the token.

202
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,270
How could this happen?

203
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:23,430
What did that child look like?

204
00:10:23,470 --> 00:10:24,370
It was a boy.

205
00:10:24,570 --> 00:10:25,300
What did he look like?

206
00:10:25,300 --> 00:10:26,370
About one year old.

207
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:26,830
Between his ribs,

208
00:10:26,830 --> 00:10:28,900
there seemed to be a red birthmark the size of a fingernail.

209
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,370
General, are you all right?

210
00:10:30,500 --> 00:10:33,970
So that is why he did not kill me.

211
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,300
General.

212
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:40,570
The envoy delivered this wooden box.

213
00:10:40,570 --> 00:10:42,200
He said it is a reward from the Khan.

214
00:10:48,770 --> 00:10:49,600
Open it.

215
00:10:49,930 --> 00:10:50,300
Yes.

216
00:11:04,870 --> 00:11:05,630
Father.

217
00:11:08,230 --> 00:11:09,800
Father... How dare they?

218
00:11:12,070 --> 00:11:14,270
Helian Zhen dared to desecrate my father's body.

219
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:16,600
I will make him die without a place to be buried.
